MODULE: NoSpuriousRefusalParkLosesVerdict
TARGET: NoSpuriousRefusal
CLASS: Action
SUMMARY: the parked writer forgets whether it entered a saturation wait
PERTURBS: ParkOrRefuse

--- FIND
    /\ consumer' = [consumer EXCEPT !.expiry = GateValue]
--- REPLACE
\* MUTATION: lose the parked-wait witness.
    /\ consumer' = [consumer EXCEPT !.expiry = 0]
--- END
